{"id":"00233","root":"uni00233_1","name":{"ja":"朧","en":"Iga Oboro"},"title":{"ja":"【嗤う邪悪】","en":"【Sneering Evil】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【嗤う邪悪】 朧","en":"【Sneering Evil】 Iga Oboro"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","Nomad"],"release":"2019-08-31","limited":false,"characterId":4,"profile":{"ja":"傭兵を集めて朧忍軍と称し、魑魅魍魎と結託する多国籍複合企業体・ノマドに与するくノ一。元対魔忍でかつてはアサギの同僚でもあった。アサギによって一度は殺されるが、魑魅魍魎の肉体を借り、闇の闘技場＜カオス・アリーナ＞の主人として復活するも、アサギの逆襲に遭い再び撃ち滅ぼされる。しかしエドウィン・ブラックによって吸血鬼の契りを受けて再び復活、彼の先兵として暗躍している。吸血鬼となっているため、太陽光を浴びると体が焼け灰となる。得物は鉤爪。","en":"Iga Oboro leads a mercenary group called the Oboro Ninja Army, a multinational conglomerate that allies with Nomad and colludes with the chimeric spirits. Formerly a Taimanin and once a colleague of Asagi, she was killed by Asagi, but borrowed a chimeric spirit's body and returned as the master of the dark arena <Chaos Arena>, only to be slain again by Asagi's retaliation. However, Edwin Black forged a vampire pact with her, reviving her as his vanguard. As a vampire, sunlight turns her body to ash. Her weapon of choice is a pair of hooked claws."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"児玉さとみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00233_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1104,2208],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[190,380],"def":[134,268],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","300004"]},{"id":"uni00233_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1608,3216],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[305,610],"def":[193,386],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","300004","300005"]},{"id":"uni00233_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2112,4231],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[420,836],"def":[252,507],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","300004","300005","300006"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"leve